    {
      "text": "Tax Amnesty",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "PERFORMANCE OF KEY TAX HEADS"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 23,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Growth",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "PERFORMANCE OF KEY TAX HEADS"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 24,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Through the tax amnesty programme; KRA collected Kshs 43.9 Billion. This is after 2,617,111 taxpayers were granted amnesty in the Financial Year 2023/2024.",
      "block_type": "list_item",
      "heading_path": [
        "PERFORMANCE OF KEY TAX HEADS"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 25,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Tax Base Expansion",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "Tax Base Expansion"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 26,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The program enabled KRA to collect Kshs.24.62 Billion in revenue. Some of the initiatives under the TBE include recruitment of landlords under the Monthly Rental Income (MRI) obligation and Block Management System (BMS) to map out potential taxpayers. Through the programme KRA recruited 1,247,543 additional active taxpayers in the period under review.",
      "block_type": "list_item",
      "heading_path": [
        "Tax Base Expansion"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 27,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "PAYE Kshs. 543.186 Bn",
      "block_type": "caption",
      "heading_path": [
        "Tax Base Expansion"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 28,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "KEY REVENUE DRIVERS",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "KEY REVENUE DRIVERS"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 29,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Debt collection initiatives",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "Debt collection initiatives"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 30,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "KRA enhanced collection from debt programmes on non-compliant taxpayers; collecting a total of Kshs 103.390 Billion in FY 2023/2024. This performance is attributable to follow-ups on demand notices and the debt instalment plans agreed upon with taxpayers.",
      "block_type": "list_item",
      "heading_path": [
        "Debt collection initiatives"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 31,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Dispute resolution framework",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dispute resolution framework"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 32,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The framework enhanced revenue collection from Litigation; Alternative Dispute Resolution (ADR) and Tax Appeals Tribunal (TAT). This enabled KRA to collect Kshs 60.469 Billion from 6776 concluded cases",
      "block_type": "list_item",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dispute resolution framework"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 33,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "DOMESTIC EXCISE Kshs. 73.624 Bn",
      "block_type": "caption",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dispute resolution framework"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 34,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
