      "block_index": 35,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "CAPITAL GAINS TAX Kshs. 8.381 Bn",
      "block_type": "caption",
      "heading_path": [
        "Betting and Gaming Tax"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 36,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The integration of betting and gaming companies into the tax system has given KRA real-time access to companies in the sector. During the FY2023/24, KRA collected Kshs.24.269 Billion in Excise Duty and Withholding Tax from 111 onboarded companies",
      "block_type": "list_item",
      "heading_path": [
        "Betting and Gaming Tax"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 37,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Anti-Corruption Measures",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "Anti-Corruption Measures"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
      "block_index": 38,
      "table_ref": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The public and staff reported 883 cases involving tax malpractices This was done through the iWhistle System and led to the recovery of Kshs. 4.22 Billion.",
      "block_type": "list_item",
      "heading_path": [
        "Anti-Corruption Measures"
      ],
      "page_number": 1,
